From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:32:25 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] overlay/cross-compile: expose systemd262oldkernel

Keep the patched systemd 262 old-kernel package available as systemd262oldkernel while legacy devices select systemd 257; preserve the existing systemd_latest-oldkernel alias.
---
 overlay/cross-compile.nix | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/overlay/cross-compile.nix b/overlay/cross-compile.nix
index 6c65efee..87e0ec16 100644
--- a/overlay/cross-compile.nix
+++ b/overlay/cross-compile.nix
@@ -93,6 +93,9 @@ else
   in
   {
     inherit systemd257;
+    # Keep the patched systemd 262 for old kernels available for debugging
+    # or fallback even when the legacy profile selects systemd 257.
+    systemd262oldkernel = systemd262OldKernel;
     systemd_latest-oldkernel = systemd262OldKernel;
 
     # ModemManager's generated GDBus sources race with the static archive link
